WEBVTT

1
00:00.000 --> 00:04.800
Open a map. Check it before fieldwork.

2
00:05.200 --> 00:07.100
No map file yet?

3
00:07.100 --> 00:09.500
Download the small practice GeoPDF from
MapNero.

4
00:09.500 --> 00:10.830
This island is fictional.

5
00:10.830 --> 00:14.630
On iPhone or iPad, open Import Map, then
Select from Files. Choose your PDF.

6
00:14.630 --> 00:20.950
On Android, choose Add Map, then Import PDF
Map. Open the map and check its reference
points.

7
00:20.950 --> 00:24.300
Get the free sample at mapnero.com.

8
00:24.660 --> 00:28.490
Before leaving coverage, finish importing
your map. Keep the original file.

9
00:28.490 --> 00:33.720
If you need a basemap region, download that
separately. Check the area and zoom levels.

10
00:33.720 --> 00:38.890
Turn on airplane mode and reopen the map.
Check the area and detail you need before
the trip.

11
00:38.890 --> 00:44.900
Mapnero.com has the guides. Access varies by
plan.

12
00:45.320 --> 00:49.170
Your map opened. Is it in the right place?

13
00:49.170 --> 00:52.270
Compare several known landmarks across the
map.

14
00:52.270 --> 00:58.520
In MapNero, Location Outside can mean your
phone is outside the map’s bounds.

15
00:58.520 --> 01:03.120
That message alone does not prove the file
is unreferenced.

16
01:03.120 --> 01:08.020
Check the file format and coordinate system
before changing settings.

17
01:08.020 --> 01:13.520
Explore MapNero and the field guides at
mapnero.com.

18
01:13.520 --> 01:18.630
Get the app and full guides at mapnero.com.
Features and limits vary by plan.
